 "known_limits": [
  "Every publication time of the added series is an assumption; none is sourced.",
  "Nine old series carry no first-publication floor.",
  "A snapshot taken in the evening can hold a value its source revised after the decision time; the hash pins what was used, not what was knowable.",
  "The model is refitted on the whole history at every run, from that day's download. Yahoo restates histories, so an earlier session's score can differ between two days' runs; a ticket records only its own session.",
  "TSM shares most of its inputs with SOXX and is not independent evidence."
